        }
      ],
      "breedEn": "Yorkshire Terrier",
      "healthEn": "All clear",
      "descriptionEn": "Imported from Russia, she brings the prestigious bloodlines of top breeders (e.g. Amore Bravo) to the Great Silkyway kennel. She has a pronounced \"babyface\" look with a shorter muzzle, highly prized among enthusiasts. At the same time she is strong, with a level back, correct angulation and a scissor bite 6x6. Ti Amo Romantico Senorita passes these sought-after conformation traits and sweet expression on to her offspring.",
      "nameEn": "Ti Amo Romantico Senorita"
    },
